  "Disease and hunger have emptied the fort. Relations with Powhatan have worsened as the English demand food the drought has made scarce for everyone.": "A doença e a fome esvaziaram o forte. As relações com Powhatan pioraram à medida que os ingleses exigiam alimentos que a seca tornou escassos para todos.",
