  "Shawmut's spring solves the water crisis that plagued Charlestown. We will establish Boston on this narrow peninsula in the country of the Massachusett.": "A nascente de Shawmut resolve a crise hídrica que assolou Charlestown. Estabeleceremos Boston nesta estreita península no país de Massachusett.",
